          "type": "voice_note",
          "sender_id": "clerk",
          "duration_sec": 8,
          "transcript": "[grave tone] \"Hi {{player_name}}, Deputy Shaw from Pine County. The clerk forwarded your 1998 blueprint request—there WAS a 12-foot storm cellar under that cabin that Uncle Ray bricked over without a permit!\"",
